---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="P7｜Future Watch｜J 的世界 Research">

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-inner">
    <div class="kicker">RESEARCH · VOL.01 · P7</div>
    <h1>Future Watch：<br />下一個真正值得驗證的訊號</h1>
    <p>
      Research 的價值不只是描述現在，
      更重要的是建立一套可以持續追蹤未來變化的觀察框架。
    </p>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="section">

  <div class="section-head">
    <div>
      <div class="kicker">FUTURE WATCH</div>
      <h2>不要猜未來，要追蹤訊號。</h2>
    </div>
    <p>Verification → Adoption → Production → Scale</p>
  </div>

  <article class="card">

    <p>
      AI Platform 的技術演進通常不是一次完成。
      一項技術從概念走向商業化，
      往往會經過開發、樣品、客戶驗證、導入、量產與擴散。
    </p>

    <p>
      因此 Future Watch 不預測單一日期，
      而是追蹤每一個可以被公開資訊驗證的階段變化。
    </p>

  </article>

</section>


<section class="feature">

  <div class="section">

    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">WATCH 01</div>
        <h2>驗證 Qualification</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <article class="watch-card">

      <div class="watch-number">01</div>

      <div>
        <span class="tag">QUALIFICATION</span>
        <h3>技術是否開始進入客戶驗證？</h3>

        <p>
          這通常是從「技術可能性」走向「商業可能性」的重要分界。
        </p>

        <div class="watch-check">
          <span>□ 客戶驗證</span>
          <span>□ Sample</span>
          <span>□ Qualification</span>
          <span>□ Design-in</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </article>

  </div>

</section>


<section class="section">

  <div class="section-head">
    <div>
      <div class="kicker">WATCH 02</div>
      <h2>導入 Adoption</h2>
    </div>
  </div>

  <article class="watch-card">

    <div class="watch-number">02</div>

    <div>
      <span class="tag">ADOPTION</span>
      <h3>是否進入實際製程或產品設計？</h3>

      <p>
        驗證通過並不等於大規模商業化。
        下一個重要訊號是技術是否真正進入產品或製程。
      </p>

      <div class="watch-grid">

        <div>
          <strong>Process</strong>
          <p>是否進入實際製程？</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <strong>Design</strong>
          <p>是否進入產品設計？</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <strong>Supply Chain</strong>
          <p>是否形成穩定供應鏈關係？</p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </article>

</section>


<section class="feature">

  <div class="section">

    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">WATCH 03</div>
        <h2>量產 Production</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <article class="watch-card">

      <div class="watch-number">03</div>

      <div>
        <span class="tag">PRODUCTION</span>
        <h3>是否開始形成可觀察的產能與營收？</h3>

        <p>
          量產是技術研究進入產業基本面的重要節點。
          此階段需要開始觀察產能、營收與客戶需求。
        </p>

        <div class="watch-grid">

          <div>
            <strong>Capacity</strong>
            <p>產能是否增加？</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <strong>Revenue</strong>
            <p>營收是否開始反映？</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <strong>Volume</strong>
            <p>出貨量是否持續增加？</p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </article>

  </div>

</section>


<section class="section">

  <div class="section-head">
    <div>
      <div class="kicker">WATCH 04</div>
      <h2>擴散 Scale</h2>
    </div>
  </div>

  <article class="watch-card">

    <div class="watch-number">04</div>

    <div>
      <span class="tag">SCALE</span>
      <h3>是否由單一客戶擴展至更多 AI 平台？</h3>

      <p>
        真正形成產業趨勢，
        通常需要從單一客戶、單一產品逐漸擴展。
      </p>

      <div class="scale-flow">
        <span>Single Customer</span>
        <b>→</b>
        <span>Multiple Customers</span>
        <b>→</b>
        <span>Multiple Platforms</span>
        <b>→</b>
        <span>Industry Adoption</span>
      </div>

    </div>

  </article>

</section>


<section class="feature">

  <div class="section">

    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">FUTURE WATCH MATRIX</div>
        <h2>四個訊號，形成一條完整證據鏈</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="timeline">

      <div>
        <span>01</span>
        <strong>驗證</strong>
        <small>Qualification</small>
      </div>

      <b>→</b>

      <div>
        <span>02</span>
        <strong>導入</strong>
        <small>Adoption</small>
      </div>

      <b>→</b>

      <div>
        <span>03</span>
        <strong>量產</strong>
        <small>Production</small>
      </div>

      <b>→</b>

      <div>
        <span>04</span>
        <strong>擴散</strong>
        <small>Scale</small>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<section class="section">

  <div class="section-head">
    <div>
      <div class="kicker">WATCH LIST</div>
      <h2>Research Vol.01 的持續追蹤項目</h2>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid">

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">01</span>
      <h3>Glass Core</h3>
      <p>
        追蹤 TGV、製程整合、客戶驗證、
        良率與量產進度。
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">02</span>
      <h3>CPO</h3>
      <p>
        追蹤光引擎、交換器、
        封裝整合與資料中心導入。
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">03</span>
      <h3>Advanced Packaging</h3>
      <p>
        追蹤 CoWoS、SoIC、
        Chiplet 與新型封裝架構。
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">04</span>
      <h3>AI Infrastructure</h3>
      <p>
        追蹤 AI Server、電力、
        散熱與資料中心基礎建設。
      </p>
    </article>

  </div>

</section>


<section class="feature">

  <div class="section">

    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">CONNECTED RESEARCH</div>
        <h2>從 Future Watch 回到完整研究</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid">

      <article class="card">
        <span class="tag">P5</span>
        <h3>Glass Core</h3>
        <p>深入閱讀 Glass Core 技術路徑。</p>
        <a class="button-secondary" href="/research/p5">
          Read P5 →
        </a>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <span class="tag">P6</span>
        <h3>Investment Matrix</h3>
        <p>回到技術節點與產業觀察矩陣。</p>
        <a class="button-secondary" href="/research/p6">
          Read P6 →
        </a>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <span class="tag">P8</span>
        <h3>Methodology</h3>
        <p>下一頁整理研究方法、Evidence 與免責聲明。</p>
        <a class="button-secondary" href="/research/p8">
          Next · P8 →
        </a>
      </article>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<section class="cta">

  <div class="cta-inner">

    <div>
      <div class="kicker">NEXT · P8</div>
      <h2>最後回到 Research Methodology。</h2>
      <p>
        用 Facts First 與 Evidence-Based Research，
        建立可持續更新的研究框架。
      </p>
    </div>

    <a class="button" href="/research/p8">
      Next · P8 →
    </a>

  </div>

</section>


<style>

  .watch-card {
    border: 1px solid #354457;
    background: #0d151f;
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 30px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 90px 1fr;
    gap: 25px;
  }

  .watch-number {
    font-size: 48px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #7188a0;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .watch-card h3 {
    font-size: 25px;
    margin: 10px 0;
  }

  .watch-card p {
    color: #aeb9c6;
  }

  .watch-check {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .watch-check span {
    border: 1px solid #354457;
    border-radius: 7px;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    color: #9ba9b8;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .watch-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 22px;
  }

  .watch-grid > div {
    padding: 15px;
    border: 1px solid #2b394a;
    border-radius: 10px;
  }

  .watch-grid strong {
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .watch-grid p {
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .scale-flow,
  .timeline {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .scale-flow span,
  .timeline > div {
    padding: 12px 15px;
    border: 1px solid #354457;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: #111b26;
    color: #c5d0dc;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .scale-flow b,
  .timeline b {
    color: #7188a0;
  }

  .timeline > div {
    min-width: 150px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .timeline span {
    color: #7188a0;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .timeline strong {
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .timeline small {
    color: #7f8d9d;
  }

  .button-secondary {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 12px;
    padding: 9px 14px;
    border: 1px solid #40536a;
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: #c6d1dc;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .button-secondary:hover {
    border-color: #7188a0;
    color: #fff;
  }

  @media(max-width:800px) {

    .watch-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .watch-number {
      font-size: 38px;
    }

    .watch-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .scale-flow {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .scale-flow b,
    .timeline b {
      display: none;
    }

    .scale-flow span {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .timeline {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .timeline > div {
      width: 100%;
    }

  }

</style>

</BaseLayout>
